  "published": "2026-10-08T18:08:08.723Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.1: an application using SSRS2 publishes with PublishReadyToRun (1.4.0's engine assembly failed it). Fixes for what Report Viewer applications rely on, on .NET 8, 9 and 10: Windows' code pages (Chr and Asc past 127, the CSV renderer's Encoding), an object data source's nested [Serializable] objects, Visual Basic's StrConv widths and kana on macOS and Linux and UCase/LCase in the report's culture, a text run's Calendar as Windows lists them, Report Viewer's Code Access Security calls accepted, a picture whose bytes are no picture drawing nothing. The engine writes nothing to the console, and a report renders to the same PowerPoint or PDF file each time. Details: https://ssrs2.net",
